 Whisper large-v3 -mallia, englannille large-v3-turboa. Kieli tunnistetaan automaattisesti useasta kohdasta nauhoitusta.\n\nValmis transkripti näkyy heti ja sen voi kopioida tekstinä, aikaleimoilla, Markdownina tai muotoiltuna HTML:nä — jälkimmäinen liimautuu sähköpostiin muotoilut säilyttäen.\n\nNauhoitukset tallentuvat myös puhelimen jaettuun kansioon, joten ne säilyvät vaikka sovellus asennettaisiin uudelleen. Halutessasi ne synkronoituvat Google Driveen."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.longshoreforrest.mythoughts/en-US/icon_J7_wTZYR8CJ7VPcRsTUFsT33dEL1XsjRErWFv8-p6pY=.png", "sha256": "27bff04d9611f0227b54f711b13505b13df77442f55ec8d112b585bfcfa9ea96", "size": 68548}}, "preferredSigner": "a019fd952210785153e9abd822800f0b28d147b8d9b969e45ca4ad730c61987d"}, "versions": {"2769de582dc8f47cd40e427c4dba2bbcf00b978a89889deba2f0538bbda29359": {"added": 1785371455000, "file": {"name": "/com.longshoreforrest.mythoughts_301.apk", "sha256": "2769de582dc8f47cd40e427c4dba2bbcf00b978a89889deba2f0538bbda29359", "size": 59454001}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a"], "versionName": "0.3.1", "versionCode": 301, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 24, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["a019fd952210785153e9abd822800f0b28d147b8d9b969e45ca4ad730c61987d"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE"}, {"name": "android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MICROPHONE"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.MODIFY_AUDIO_SETTINGS"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_CALENDAR"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_MEDIA_AUDIO"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_MEDIA_IMAGES"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_MEDIA_VIDEO"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED"}, {"name": 